arketer | \\"What's trending about the Forbidden City on Xiaohongshu?\\" | Understand competitors' content strategies and user engagement |\\n| Tourism research | Researcher | \\"Show me the past 7 days of Xiaohongshu cultural tourism data\\" | Gather recent cultural tourism trend data |\\n| Automated daily report | Team Manager | \\"Subscribe to the Xiaohongshu cultural tourism daily report\\" | Daily auto-delivery keeps the team in sync |", "hasApiKey": true, "introduce": "搜索全网文旅相关小红书热门笔记，按点赞量筛选最火内容，自动按主题聚类并生成精美的可视化报告，支持时间范围筛选与每日自动订阅。", "skillCode": "cultural-tourism-xiaohongshu-feed", "skillName": "文旅小红书信息源", "sortOrder": 0, "viewCount": 21345, "categories": [{"categoryCode": "data_query", "categoryName": "数据查询"}], "categoryId": null, "createTime": "2026-06-24 14:14:15", "updateTime": "2026-06-26 16:11:19", "usageCount": 0, "description": null, "introduceEn": "Search Xiaohongshu for trending cultural tourism posts, ranked by likes with automatic topic clustering. Generates a polished HTML visual report with time range filtering and daily subscription support.", "platformInfo": "[{\\"name\\":\\"github\\",\\"repo\\":\\"https://github.com/redfox-data/redfox-community/tree/main/skills/cultural-tourism-xiaohongshu-feed\\"},{\\"name\\":\\"skills-cli\\",\\"repo\\":\\"redfox-data/redfox-community\\"}]", "displayStatus": 0, "downloadCount": 49220}	2026-07-01 10:23:45.342	2026-06-30 07:58:35.822	2026-07-01 10:23:45.43
