rstand competitors' content strategies and user engagement |\\n| Tourism research | Researcher | \\"Show me the past 7 days of Douyin cultural tourism data\\" | Gather recent cultural tourism trend data |\\n| Automated daily report | Team Manager | \\"Subscribe to the Douyin cultural tourism daily report\\" | Daily auto-delivery keeps the team in sync |", "hasApiKey": true, "introduce": "搜索全网文旅相关抖音热门作品，按点赞量筛选最火内容，自动按主题聚类并生成精美的可视化报告，支持时间范围筛选与每日自动订阅。", "skillCode": "cultural-tourism-douyin-feed", "skillName": "文旅抖音信息源", "sortOrder": 0, "viewCount": 35145, "categories": [{"categoryCode": "data_query", "categoryName": "数据查询"}], "categoryId": null, "createTime": "2026-06-24 14:15:40", "updateTime": "2026-06-26 16:11:06", "usageCount": 0, "description": null, "introduceEn": "Search Douyin for trending cultural tourism content, ranked by likes with automatic topic clustering. Generates a polished HTML visual report with time range filtering and daily subscription support.", "platformInfo": "[{\\"name\\":\\"github\\",\\"repo\\":\\"https://github.com/redfox-data/redfox-community/tree/main/skills/cultural-tourism-douyin-feed\\"},{\\"name\\":\\"skills-cli\\",\\"repo\\":\\"redfox-data/redfox-community\\"}]", "displayStatus": 0, "downloadCount": 69449}	2026-07-01 10:23:45.342	2026-06-30 07:58:35.825	2026-07-01 10:23:45.434
cmr0cul9w010ii33p1m0yw1vi	HBjH7jCY	douyin-comment	抖音评论分析	douyin	uncategorized	["对标分析", "douyin", "uncategorized"]			\N	\N	available	{"icon": "iconfont:douyin", "tags": ["对标分析"], "price": 0, "nameEn": "Douyin Comment Search", "readme": "# 抖音评论分析 / douyin-comment\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 简介\\n\\n输入抖音作品链接就能拉取评论数据，AI 自动帮你分析好评、吐槽、需求和竞品讨论，支持翻页浏览，还能导出精美 HTML 报告保存或分享。\\n\\n**核心价值**\\n\\n- **操作简单，粘贴即用**：给个作品链接就行，不用记命令、不用学参数，直接出结果。\\n- **内容新鲜不滞后**：每次请求都从平台拉最新评论，不会拿老旧缓存糊弄你。\\n- **AI 帮你读懂评论**：自动识别好评、吐槽、用户需求和竞品讨论四类内容，提炼关键要点，不用自己一条条翻。\\n- **翻页浏览不封顶**：每页 20 条，想看多少翻多少，再多的评论也能看完。\\n- **精美报告可分享**：深色主题 HTML 报告，数据分析 + 原始评论一目了然，适合保存或转发给同事。\\n\\n**适用对象**\\n\\n- 🔍 抖音创作者 — 快速了解观众对视频的真实反馈，找准内容优化方向。\\n- 📊 运营 / 数据分析 — 追踪评论区舆情动态，量化用户情绪变化。\\n- 🏢 品牌 / MCN — 监控竞品视频评论风向，辅助投放与内容策略决策。\\n- 🛒 电商 / 带货 — 分析商品视频评论中的用户需求与竞品讨论，优化带货话术。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 功能特性\\n\\n### 核心功能\\n\\n- **链接提取**：支持直接粘贴抖音作品链接，自动识别作品 ID，无需手动提取。\\n- **评论获取**：获取作品一级评论数据，每页 20 条按时间倒序展示。\\n- **AI 智能分析**：四维情感总结（积极评价 / 负面评价 / 用户需求 / 竞品对比），理解抖音梗文化。\\n- **分页浏览**：支持逐页翻阅，大评论区也能完整浏览。\\n- **置顶标记**：置顶评论自动高亮标注，一眼识别重要声音。\\n- **可视化报告**：深色主题 HTML 报告，含原始评论表格与 AI 分析摘要，支持离线保存。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 密钥获取与安全说明\\n\\n- 本技能需要使用环境变量：`REDFOX_API_KEY`。\\n- `REDFOX_API_KEY` 由 [红狐 hub](https://redfox.hk/settings/api-keys?source=github) (`https://redfox.hk`)提供。\\n- 请前往 [红狐 hub](https://redfox.hk?source=github) 注册账号，获取 `REDFOX_API_KEY`。\\n- 配置设备环境变量 `REDFOX_API_KEY` 后使用本技能。\\n- 在提供密钥前，请先确认密钥来源、可用范围、有效期及是否支持重置/撤销。\\n- 禁止在代码、提示词、日志或输出文件中硬编码/明文暴露密钥。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用指南\\n\\n直接用自然语言描述需求，无需记忆命令。\\n\\n### 常用说法速查\\n\\n| 意图 | 示例话术 | 效果 |\\n| ---- | -------- | ---- |\\n| 通过链接查评论 | 「https://www.douyin.com/video/7131700643076623629 这篇的评论怎么样」 | 自动提取作品 ID，拉取评论并展示分析 |\\n| 通过作品 ID 查评论 | 「看下抖音作品 7131700643076623629 的评论」 | 直接拉取评论数据，展示分析摘要 |\\n| 翻页查看更多 | 「下一页」 | 加载后续评论，继续分析 |\\n| 导出报告 | 「生成 html」 | 将当页评论数据与分析导出为精美 HTML 报告 |\\n\\n### 输出示例\\n\\n执行后你会收到：\\n\\n📊 作品「**7131700643076623629**」共获取 **20 条**评论（第 1 页），以下是详细数据：\\n\\n| # | 评论人 | 评论内容 | 👍 | 💬 | 时间 | IP |\\n|---|--------|---------|----|----|------|-----|\\n| 1 | 用户头像 用户昵称 | 这个视频太棒了... | 1223 | 213 | 02-12 15:30 | 广东 |\\n| 2 | 用户头像 用户昵称 | 学到了学到了... | 856 | 45 | 02-12 14:20 | 北京 |\\n| …… | …… | …… | …… | …… | …… | …… |\\n\\n📈 评论总结分析，包含积极评价 / 负面评价 / 用户需求 / 竞品对比四个维度的要点提炼。\\n\\n📄 当前第 1 页（共 20 条）。回复「下一页」继续查看。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用场景\\n\\n| 场景 | 角色 | 示例问法 | 收益 |\\n| ---- | ---- | -------- | ---- |\\n| 内容反馈分析 | 抖音创作者 | 「帮我看下这个视频的评论」 | 快速了解观众真实态度，定位内容优化方向 |\\n| 评论舆情监控 | 品牌运营 | 「分析这个视频的评论舆情」 | 自动识别正面 / 负面 / 需求讨论，量化情绪分布 |\\n| 竞品评论调研 | MCN / 市场 | 「看看竞品这条视频的评论在聊什么」 | 掌握竞品评论区讨论焦点与用户偏好 |\\n| 带货效果评估 | 电商运营 | 「分析这个带货视频评论里的用户需求」 | 提取评论区购买意向与竞品提及，优化转化话术 |", "status": 1, "iconUrl": null, "skillNo": "HBjH7jCY", "readmeEn": "# Douyin Comment Search / douyin-comment\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Overview\\n\\nPaste a Douyin video link to pull up its comment data. AI automatically analyzes praise, complaints, needs, and competitor discussions. Supports paginated browsing and exports a polished HTML report for saving or sharing.\\n\\n**Core Value**\\n\\n- **Simple & instant**: Just drop a video link — no commands, no parameters, results in seconds.\\n- **Fresh content, no lag**: Every request pulls the latest comments directly from the platform, no stale caches.\\n- **AI reads the comments for you**: Automatically identifies praise, complaints, user needs, and competitor mentions across four categories, distilling key takeaways so you don't have to scroll through everything.\\n- **Unlimited pagination**: 20 comments per page, flip through as many as you like — even huge comment sections are no problem.\\n- **Shareable polished reports**: Dark-themed HTML report with data analysis and raw comments in one view, perfect for saving or forwarding to colleagues.\\n\\n**Who It's For**\\n\\n- 🔍 Douyin Creators — Quickly gauge audience reactions to your videos and find content optimization opportunities.\\n- 📊 Operations / Data Analysts — Track comment section sentiment dynamics and quantify user emotion shifts.\\n- 🏢 Brands / MCNs — Monitor competitor video comment trends to inform ad placement and content strategy.\\n- 🛒 E-commerce / Live-shopping — Analyze user needs and competitor mentions in product video comments to refine sales pitches.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Features\\n\\n### Core Features\\n\\n- **Link extraction**: Paste a Douyin video link directly — the video ID is extracted automatically, no need to copy IDs by hand.\\n- **Comment retrieval**: Fetches top-level comments, 20 per page displayed in reverse chronological order.\\n- **AI-powered analysis**: Four-dimensional sentiment summary (positive / negative / user needs / competitor comparison) with awareness of Douyin meme culture.\\n- **Paginated browsing**: Flip through page by page, easily covering large comment sections.\\n- **Pinned comment highlight**: Pinned comments are automatically highlighted so important voices stand out.\\n- **Visual report**: Dark-themed HTML report with raw comment tables and AI analysis summaries, fully available offline.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## API Key Acquisition & Security\\n\\n- This skill requires the environment variable: `REDFOX_API_KEY`.\\n- `REDFOX_API_KEY` is provided by [RedFoxHub](https://redfox.hk/settings/api-keys?source=github) (`https://redfox.hk`).\\n- Visit [RedFoxHub](https://redfox.hk?source=github) to register and obtain your `REDFOX_API_KEY`.\\n- Configure the `REDFOX_API_KEY` environment variable on your device before using this skill.\\n- Before providing your key, verify its source, scope, validity period, and whether it supports reset/revocation.\\n- Do not hardcode or expose the key in plain text within code, prompts, logs, or output files.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Usage Guide\\n\\nSimply describe what you need in natural language — no commands to memorize.\\n\\n### Quick Reference\\n\\n| Intent | Example Phrase | Result |\\n| ------ | -------------- | ------ |\\n| Search by link | \\"What are the comments like on https://www.douyin.com/video/7131700643076623629\\" | Automatically extracts video ID, fetches comments and displays analysis |\\n| Search by video ID | \\"Show me the comments on Douyin video 7131700643076623629\\" | Fetches comment data and presents analysis summary |\\n| Flip to next page | \\"Next page\\" | Loads subsequent comments and continues analysis |\\n| Export report | \\"Generate HTML\\" | Exports the current page's comment data and analysis as a polished HTML report |\\n\\n### Sample Output\\n\\nHere's what you'll receive:\\n\\n📊 Video **7131700643076623629** — **20** comments fetched (Page 1), details below:\\n\\n| # | Commenter | Comment | 👍 | 💬 | Time | IP |\\n|---|-----------|---------|----|----|------|-----|\\n| 1 | avatar username | This video is amazing... | 1223 | 213 | 02-12 15:30 | Guangdong |\\n| 2 | avatar username | Learned so much... | 856 | 45 | 02-12 14:20 | Beijing |\\n| … | … | … | … | … | … | … |\\n\\n📈 Comment analysis summary covering four dimensions: positive feedback / negative feedback / user needs / competitor comparison.\\n\\n📄 Currently on Page 1 (20 comments). Reply \\"next page\\" to continue.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Use Cases\\n\\n| Scenario | Role | Example Query | Benefit |\\n| -------- | ---- | ------------- | ------- |\\n| Content feedback analysis | Douyin Creator | \\"Check the comments on this video for me\\" | Quickly understand real audience sentiment and identify content improvements |\\n| Comment sentiment monitoring | Brand Operator | \\"Analyze the sentiment of this video's comments\\" | Automatically identify positive / negative / demand discussions and quantify sentiment distribution |\\n| Competitor comment research | MCN / Marketing | \\"See what people are saying in this competitor's comments\\" | Grasp competitor comment section focus and user preferences |\\n| Live-shopping performance evaluation | E-commerce Operator | \\"Analyze user needs in this product video's comments\\" | Extract purchase intent and competitor mentions to optimize conversion scripts |", "hasApiKey": true, "introduce": "输入抖音作品链接就能拉取评论数据，AI 自动帮你分析好评、吐槽、需求和竞品讨论，支持翻页浏览，还能导出精美 HTML 报告保存或分享。", "skillCode": "douyin-comment", "skillName": "抖音评论分析", "sortOrder": 0, "viewCount": 16273, "categories": [{"categoryCode": "work_analysis", "categoryName": "作品分析"}], "categoryId": null, "createTime": "2026-06-24 14:41:20", "updateTime": "2026-06-26 16:09:06", "usageCount": 0, "description": null, "introduceEn": "Paste a Douyin video link to pull up its comment data. AI automatically analyzes praise, complaints, needs, and competitor discussions. Supports paginated browsing and exports a polished HTML report for saving or sharing.", "platformInfo": "[{\\"name\\":\\"github\\",\\"repo\\":\\"https://github.com/redfox-data/redfox-community/tree/main/skills/douyin-comment\\"},{\\"name\\":\\"skills-cli\\",\\"repo\\":\\"redfox-data/redfox-community\\"}]", "displayStatus": 0, "downloadCount": 29054}	2026-07-01 10:23:45.342	2026-06-30 07:58:35.829	2026-07-01 10:23:45.437
