完整拉伸教学...](链接) | 谭成义 | 5.0w | 677 | 8928 | 3.8w |\\n\\n> 📄 当前第 **1** 页。回复「下一页」继续查看。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用场景\\n\\n| 场景 | 角色 | 示例问法 | 收益 |\\n| ---- | ---- | -------- | ---- |\\n| 赛道实时摸底 | 内容运营 | 「搜一下现在健身赛道最新的内容」 | 第一时间掌握竞品与赛道当前动态 |\\n| 追热点选题 | 创作者 | 「看看最近7天AIGC最多点赞的作品」 | 找到当前高互动方向，精准跟热点 |\\n| 发布时机研判 | 博主 | 「最近30天职场穿搭最新发布的有哪些」 | 了解同类内容发布节奏与密度 |\\n| 持续监控关键词 | 品牌运营 | 「订阅「品牌词」每日推送」 | 每天自动获取最新提及，及时响应 |", "status": 1, "iconUrl": null, "skillNo": "v6gygjJz", "readmeEn": "# Douyin Realtime Search / douyin-realtime-search\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Introduction\\n\\nEnter any keyword to instantly retrieve the latest content data from Douyin — no cached history, just what's happening right now.\\n\\n**Core Value**\\n\\n- Real-time results: Directly connects to Douyin's search service, reflecting the current state of the platform rather than historical archives\\n- Flexible filtering: Freely combine sorting (comprehensive / latest published / most liked) and time range (7 days / 30 days / 90 days / unlimited)\\n- Structured display: Title, author, likes, comments, shares, and collections at a glance — click any title to jump directly to the original video\\n\\n**Who It's For**\\n\\n- 📊 **Content operators / Strategy researchers** — Quickly grasp the real-time heat and emerging trends in any content vertical\\n- 🎬 **Creators / Influencers** — Stay on top of the latest content in your niche and find the right moment to publish\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Features\\n\\n### Core Capabilities\\n\\n- **Keyword real-time search**: Enter a niche keyword and instantly pull the live content list from Douyin\\n- **Multi-dimensional filtering**: Combine sorting method and time range freely for precise results\\n- **Paginated results**: Search results support pagination — default shows page 1, reply \\"next page\\" to browse more\\n- **Filter transparency**: After each result, shows the active sorting, time parameters, and current page with switch instructions\\n- **Daily subscription**: Subscribe to a keyword for automatic daily pushes at 10:00 AM\\n\\n---\\n\\n## API Key Acquisition & Security\\n\\n- This skill requires the environment variable: `REDFOX_API_KEY`.\\n- `REDFOX_API_KEY` is provided by [RedFoxHub](https://redfox.hk/settings/api-keys?source=github) (`https://redfox.hk`).\\n- Visit [RedFoxHub](https://redfox.hk?source=github) to register and obtain your `REDFOX_API_KEY`.\\n- Configure the `REDFOX_API_KEY` environment variable on your device before using this skill.\\n- Before providing your key, confirm its source, scope, expiration, and whether it supports reset/revocation.\\n- Never hardcode or expose your key in plaintext within code, prompts, logs, or output files.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Usage Guide\\n\\nJust describe your need in plain language — no commands to memorize.\\n\\n### Quick Reference\\n\\n| Intent | Example | Effect |\\n| ------ | ------- | ------ |\\n| Search a keyword | \\"fitness\\" / \\"office outfits\\" | Searches with default sorting (comprehensive) and time range (7 days) |\\n| Specify sort order | \\"Search weight loss by latest published\\" | Switches to latest-published sorting |\\n| Specify time range | \\"Search AIGC content from the past 30 days\\" | Sets time filter to last 30 days |\\n| Combined filters | \\"Search ancient fitness by most liked, past 90 days\\" | Applies both sort and time filters simultaneously |\\n| Switch filters | \\"Re-search by latest published, past 30 days\\" | Keeps the keyword, updates filter parameters |\\n| Pagination | \\"Next page\\" / \\"Previous page\\" | Navigate through paginated search results |\\n| Subscribe daily | \\"Confirm subscription\\" | Creates a scheduled task to push results daily at 10:00 AM |\\n\\n### Output Example\\n\\nAfter a search, you'll receive results in this format:\\n\\n> 📊 Keyword \\"**fitness**\\" — **9 results** found in real time (Sort: Comprehensive | Time: Last 7 days | Page 1):\\n\\n| # | Title | Author | Likes | Comments | Shares | Collections |\\n|---|-------|--------|-------|----------|--------|-------------|\\n| 1 | [Liang Zi came to the base!...](link) | 健身华哥 | 61.5w | 3.5w | 33.3w | 2.2w |\\n| 2 | [Full-body stretching tutorial...](link) | 谭成义 | 5.0w | 677 | 8928 | 3.8w |\\n\\n> 📄 Page **1**. Reply \\"next page\\" to continue browsing.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Use Cases\\n\\n| Scenario | Role | Example | Benefit |\\n| -------- | ---- | ------- | ------- |\\n| Niche reconnaissance | Content operator | \\"Show me the latest fitness content right now\\" | Instantly understand what competitors are publishing |\\n| Trend-driven ideation | Creator | \\"Most liked AIGC videos in the past 7 days\\" | Find high-engagement directions to ride the wave |\\n| Publish timing research | Influencer | \\"Latest office outfit videos in the past 30 days\\" | Understand posting rhythm and content density in your niche |\\n| Keyword monitoring | Brand operator | \\"Subscribe to daily push for [brand keyword]\\" | Receive automatic daily updates for timely response |", "hasApiKey": true, "introduce": "输入任意关键词，实时拉取抖音平台当下最新作品数据，告别历史缓存、看见真正的现在。", "skillCode": "douyin-realtime-search", "skillName": "抖音实时作品搜索", "sortOrder": 0, "viewCount": 111538, "categories": [{"categoryCode": "data_query", "categoryName": "数据查询"}], "categoryId": 4, "createTime": "2026-06-02 16:52:33", "updateTime": "2026-06-11 15:00:01", "usageCount": 0, "description": null, "introduceEn": "Enter any keyword to instantly retrieve the latest content data from Douyin — no cached history, just what's happening right now.", "platformInfo": "[{\\"name\\": \\"github\\", \\"repo\\": \\"https://github.com/redfox-data/redfox-community/tree/main/skills/douyin-realtime-search\\"}, {\\"name\\": \\"skills-cli\\", \\"repo\\": \\"redfox-data/redfox-community\\"}]", "displayStatus": 0, "downloadCount": 59385}	2026-07-01 10:23:45.342	2026-07-01 10:23:45.599	2026-07-01 10:23:45.599
cmr1xh4g10055i3k93w4hk5t0	pura5VDP	multi-rewrite	多平台文案风格改写	xiaohongshu	uncategorized	["多平台改写", "文案改写", "内容创作", "xiaohongshu", "uncategorized"]			\N	\N	available	{"icon": "iconfont:bigdata", "tags": ["多平台改写", "文案改写", "内容创作"], "price": 0, "nameEn": "Multi-Platform Copy Rewrite", "readme": "# 多平台文案风格改写 / multi-rewrite\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 简介\\n\\n把同一段原文一次改写成 **公众号、视频号、抖音、快手、哔站、小红书、知乎** 等平台各自习惯的表达，省去逐平台手工适配的时间。\\n\\n**核心价值**\\n\\n- **一稿多平台**：指定一个或多个目标平台，或输入「全部」，批量得到各平台风格成稿\\n- **平台调性对齐**：各版本按对应平台的标题、语气、结构与标签习惯改写，而非简单同义替换\\n- **清单式交付**：每个平台独立成条，分隔清晰，便于复制到各渠道发布\\n- **自然语言即可**：说出平台名和原文即可，无需记忆固定命令\\n\\n**适用对象**\\n\\n- 📱 **自媒体 / MCN** — 同一主题快速铺量到七大平台\\n- 🏢 **品牌 / 市场** — 统一核心信息，分平台呈现不同话术\\n- ✍️ **内容运营** — 把长文、活动稿、产品介绍拆成各平台可读版本\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 功能特性\\n\\n### 核心功能\\n\\n- **单平台改写**：指定如「抖音」「小红书」等，输出该平台风格全文\\n- **多平台批量改写**：一次选择多个平台（空格或逗号分隔），逐条列出各平台成稿\\n- **全平台一键改写**：输入「全部 / all / 所有」，覆盖七个支持平台\\n- **平台自动识别**：从话术中识别目标平台；未识别时会引导你补充平台选择\\n- **小红书专属标签**：小红书版本在正文末尾附带 `#` 话题标签\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用指南\\n\\n直接说明目标平台和要改写的文案即可。\\n\\n### 常用说法速查\\n\\n| 意图           | 示例话术                                           | 效果                               |\\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\\n| 单平台改写     | 「抖音 今天天气真好，适合出门散步」                | 输出一条抖音风格成稿               |\\n| 多平台批量     | 「抖音 小红书 知乎 这款防晒霜很好用，清爽不油腻」  | 分别给出三个平台的改写版本         |\\n| 全平台一键     | 「全部 周年庆全场 5 折起，限时 3 天」              | 七个平台各一条，列表形式展示       |\\n| 未指定平台     | 「帮我把下面这段改写成各平台能发的：[你的原文]」   | 会询问你想覆盖哪些平台后再继续     |\\n\\n### 输出示例\\n\\n改写完成后，你会收到按平台分条的列表，示意如下：\\n\\n```text\\n## 改写结果\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 1. 📌 公众号\\n\\n[公众号风格改写内容]\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. 📌 抖音\\n\\n[抖音风格改写内容]\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. 📌 小红书\\n\\n[小红书风格改写内容]\\n\\n#标签1 #标签2 #标签3\\n\\n---\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用场景\\n\\n| 场景           | 角色       | 示例问法                                           | 收益                         |\\n| -------------- | ---------- | -------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\\n| 活动多渠分发   | 品牌运营   | 「全部 把这条促销文案改成各平台能发的版本」        | 一次改完，分平台复制发布     |\\n| 重点平台对比   | 自媒体博主 | 「抖音和小红书 这篇测评笔记帮我各改一版」          | 同主题适配不同受众阅读习惯   |\\n| 长文拆平台     | 内容编辑   | 「公众号 知乎 把这篇干货大纲扩成两个平台正文」     | 减少重复构思与口吻切换成本   |\\n| 新平台试水     | 新手创作者 | 「快手 第一次发，帮我把这段介绍改得接地气一点」    | 快速得到符合平台习惯的成稿   |\\n\\n---", "status": 1, "iconUrl": null, "skillNo": "pura5VDP", "readmeEn": "# Multi-Platform Copy Rewrite / multi-rewrite\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Introduction\\n\\nTurn one source draft into copy tailored for **WeChat Official Accounts, Channels, Douyin, Kuaishou, Bilibili, Xiaohongshu, and Zhihu**—without hand-adapting tone and structure for each channel.\\n\\n**Core Value**\\n\\n- **One draft, many platforms**: Pick one or more targets—or say “all”—and get styled versions in one pass\\n- **Platform-native tone**: Each version follows that platform’s title habits, voice, structure, and tags—not mere paraphrasing\\n- **List-style delivery**: One block per platform, clearly separated, ready to copy into each channel\\n- **Natural language only**: Name the platform(s) and paste your text; no commands to memorize\\n\\n**Who It’s For**\\n\\n- 📱 **Creators / MCNs** — Repurpose the same theme across seven major platforms quickly\\n- 🏢 **Brand / marketing teams** — Keep one core message, express it per platform\\n- ✍️ **Content ops** — Turn long articles, campaigns, or product copy into channel-ready posts\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Features\\n\\n### Core Capabilities\\n\\n- **Single-platform rewrite**: Specify e.g. Douyin or Xiaohongshu and get one full styled piece\\n- **Multi-platform batch**: Select several platforms (space- or comma-separated) and receive each version as its own item\\n- **All platforms at once**: Say “全部 / all / 所有” for all seven supported platforms\\n- **Platform auto-detection**: Parses platform names from your message; if none are found, you’ll be asked which to use\\n- **Xiaohongshu tags**: The Xiaohongshu version includes `#` topic tags at the end\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Usage Guide\\n\\nState the target platform(s) and the copy you want rewritten.\\n\\n### Quick Reference\\n\\n| Intent              | Example phrase                                                         | Result                                      |\\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\\n| Single platform     | “Douyin: Great weather today, perfect for a walk”                      | One Douyin-style piece                      |\\n| Multiple platforms  | “Douyin Xiaohongshu Zhihu: This sunscreen is light and non-greasy”     | Three separate styled versions              |\\n| All platforms       | “All: Anniversary sale—50% off, 3 days only”                           | Seven versions in a list                    |\\n| Platform not stated | “Rewrite this for every platform: [your draft]”                        | You’ll be asked which platforms to include  |\\n\\n### Output Example\\n\\nAfter rewriting, you receive a per-platform list, roughly like:\\n\\n```text\\n## Rewrite Results\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 1. 📌 WeChat Official Account\\n\\n[WeChat-style copy]\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. 📌 Douyin\\n\\n[Douyin-style copy]\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. 📌 Xiaohongshu\\n\\n[Xiaohongshu-style copy]\\n\\n#tag1 #tag2 #tag3\\n\\n---\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Use Cases\\n\\n| Scenario              | Role          | Example question                                              | Benefit                                    |\\n| --------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\\n| Multi-channel campaign| Brand ops     | “All: Turn this promo into versions for every platform”       | Rewrite once, publish everywhere           |\\n| Focused A/B channels  | Creator       | “Douyin and Xiaohongshu: Two versions of this review note”    | Same topic, two audience reading habits    |\\n| Long-form split       | Editor        | “WeChat + Zhihu: Expand this outline into two full posts”     | Less rework switching voice and structure  |\\n| New channel trial     | New creator   | “Kuaishou: Make this intro more down-to-earth for first post” | Channel-ready copy without guessing tone   |\\n\\n---", "hasApiKey": false, "introduce": "把同一段原文一次改写成 **公众号、视频号、抖音、快手、哔站、小红书、知乎** 等平台各自习惯的表达，省去逐平台手工适配的时间。", "skillCode": "multi-rewrite", "skillName": "多平台文案风格改写", "sortOrder": 0, "viewCount": 70775, "categories": [{"categoryCode": "creation_assistant", "categoryName": "创作助手"}], "categoryId": 2, "createTime": "2026-06-02 16:53:52", "updateTime": "2026-06-11 15:00:01", "usageCount": 0, "description": null, "introduceEn": "Turn one source draft into copy tailored for **WeChat Official Accounts, Channels, Douyin, Kuaishou, Bilibili, Xiaohongshu, and Zhihu**—without hand-adapting tone and structure for each channel.", "platformInfo": "[{\\"name\\": \\"github\\", \\"repo\\": \\"https://github.com/redfox-data/redfox-community/tree/main/skills/multi-rewrite\\"}, {\\"name\\": \\"skills-cli\\", \\"repo\\": \\"redfox-data/redfox-community\\"}]", "displayStatus": 0, "downloadCount": 183778}	2026-07-01 10:23:45.342	2026-07-01 10:23:45.602	2026-07-01 10:23:45.602
cmr1xh4g40056i3k98hzc6nw5	D5V2dq8n	wechat-rewrite	公众号文案改写	xiaohongshu	uncategorized	["文案改写", "内容创作", "xiaohongshu", "uncategorized"]			\N	\N	available	{"icon": "iconfont:wechat", "tags": ["文案改写", "内容创作"], "price": 0, "nameEn": "WeChat Official Account Copy Rewrite", "readme": "# 公众号文案改写 / wechat-rewrite\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 简介\\n\\n把任意草稿改写成高阅读潜力的公众号爆款文案——标题有钩子、正文有态度，并自然融入公众号特色表达。\\n\\n**核心价值**\\n\\n- **风格一键转化**：以发起者视角输出，保留原文段落结构，整体切换为公众号口语化、犀利直接的文风\\n- **爆款结构对齐**：标题控制在 20 字内，正文参考爆款开头钩子、分点结构与结尾互动引导\\n- **特色词汇融入**：从指南、教程、秘籍等高频词中选取 2～3 个，自然写入正文，增强平台辨识度\\n- **可读可传播**：金句总结、适度 Emoji、结尾 Tags，方便读者阅读与转发\\n\\n**适用对象**\\n\\n- ✍️ **公众号运营** — 快速把素材改写成可发布的爆款口吻文章\\n- 📱 **自媒体创作者** — 将笔记、演讲稿等改写成更适合微信阅读的表达\\n- 🏢 **品牌 / 市场** — 统一对外稿件的公众号风格，提升打开率与互动\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 功能特性\\n\\n### 核心功能\\n\\n- **文案风格改写**：输入原文，输出公众号风格的标题 + 正文（以作者身份直接给出成稿）\\n- **爆款标题**：数字型、疑问句、感叹句等钩子写法，标题不超过 20 字\\n- **正文结构优化**：痛点共鸣、分点说明、对比展示；结尾引导评论互动，附带 5～10 个相关 Tags\\n- **行文原则内置**：强调「跟我有关、对我有用」、观点鲜明、情感共鸣，避免枯燥说教\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用指南\\n\\n直接粘贴或描述你要改写的文案即可。\\n\\n### 常用说法速查\\n\\n| 意图         | 示例话术                                         | 效果                               |\\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\\n| 改写一篇成稿 | 「帮我把下面这段改成公众号爆款风格：[你的原文]」 | 输出标题 + 正文，含互动引导与 Tags |\\n| 只要标题     | 「给这段内容起一个 20 字内的公众号爆款标题」     | 给出符合钩子规律的标题             |\\n| 强化观点     | 「改写得再犀利一点，多加金句」                   | 在爆款结构下加强态度与传播点       |\\n| 指定语气     | 「口语化一些，像跟读者聊天」                     | 亲切自然、短句为主的公众号口吻     |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用场景\\n\\n| 场景            | 角色       | 示例问法                                       | 收益                       |\\n| --------------- | ---------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\\n| 日常推文改稿    | 公众号编辑 | 「这篇产品介绍太书面了，改成公众号能发的版本」 | 缩短从素材到可发布稿的时间 |\\n| 多平台内容复用  | 自媒体博主 | 「把这篇小红书笔记改写成公众号文章」           | 同一主题适配微信阅读习惯   |\\n| 活动 / 促销文案 | 品牌运营   | 「把活动通知改得更有紧迫感、更像爆款推文」     | 提升打开意愿与转发传播     |\\n| 知识类长文      | 内容创作者 | 「把干货大纲扩写成有钩子的公众号正文」         | 结构清晰、可读性更强       |\\n\\n---", "status": 1, "iconUrl": null, "skillNo": "D5V2dq8n", "readmeEn": "# WeChat Official Account Copy Rewrite / wechat-rewrite\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Introduction\\n\\nTurn any draft into WeChat official-account copy built for reads—hook-driven titles, bold voice, and natural platform-style wording.\\n\\n**Core Value**\\n\\n- **One-step style conversion**: Output as the author; keep the original paragraph structure while shifting to conversational, direct WeChat tone\\n- **Viral structure**: Titles within 20 characters; body follows proven openers, bullet structure, and closing engagement prompts\\n- **Platform keywords**: Weave in 2–3 terms such as guide, tutorial, or playbook naturally for stronger platform fit\\n- **Readable and shareable**: Memorable lines, light emoji, and closing tags for easier reading and sharing\\n\\n**Who It’s For**\\n\\n- ✍️ **WeChat operators** — Turn source material into publish-ready viral-style posts quickly\\n- 📱 **Creators** — Adapt notes or scripts into copy that reads well on WeChat\\n- 🏢 **Brand / marketing teams** — Align outbound messaging with WeChat style to improve opens and engagement\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Features\\n\\n### Core Capabilities\\n\\n- **Style rewrite**: Provide your source text; get a WeChat-style title and body delivered as finished copy\\n- **Viral titles**: Number-led, question, or exclamation hooks; title length capped at 20 characters\\n- **Body structure**: Pain-point openers, bullet sections, contrast; closing comment prompts plus 5–10 relevant tags\\n- **Built-in principles**: Emphasize relevance and practical value, clear stance, emotional resonance—avoid dry lecturing\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Usage Guide\\n\\nPaste or describe the copy you want rewritten.\\n\\n### Quick Reference\\n\\n| Intent               | Example phrase                                              | Result                                       |\\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\\n| Rewrite a full piece | “Rewrite this in WeChat viral style: [your draft]”          | Title + body with engagement prompt and tags |\\n| Title only           | “Give me a WeChat viral title under 20 characters for this” | Hook-driven title                            |\\n| Stronger tone        | “Make it sharper with more memorable lines”                 | Bolder stance within viral structure         |\\n| Conversational tone  | “More casual, like chatting with readers”                   | Friendly, short-sentence WeChat voice        |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Use Cases\\n\\n| Scenario             | Role            | Example question                                                  | Benefit                               |\\n| -------------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\\n| Daily post editing   | WeChat editor   | “This product intro is too formal—make it publishable for WeChat” | Faster path from source to post       |\\n| Cross-platform reuse | Creator         | “Turn this Xiaohongshu note into a WeChat article”                | Same topic, WeChat-optimized reading  |\\n| Campaign copy        | Brand ops       | “Rewrite this promo with more urgency, like a viral post”         | Better opens and shares               |\\n| Knowledge long-form  | Content creator | “Expand this outline into a hook-driven WeChat article”           | Clear structure, stronger readability |\\n\\n---", "hasApiKey": false, "introduce": "把任意草稿改写成高阅读潜力的公众号爆款文案——标题有钩子、正文有态度，并自然融入公众号特色表达。", "skillCode": "wechat-rewrite", "skillName": "公众号文案改写", "sortOrder": 0, "viewCount": 52057, "categories": [{"categoryCode": "gzh_skills", "categoryName": "公众号创作技能包"}], "categoryId": 9, "createTime": "2026-06-02 16:55:00", "updateTime": "2026-06-11 15:00:01", "usageCount": 0, "description": null, "introduceEn": "Turn any draft into WeChat official-account copy built for reads—hook-driven titles, bold voice, and natural platform-style wording.", "platformInfo": "[{\\"name\\": \\"github\\", \\"repo\\": \\"https://github.com/redfox-data/redfox-community/tree/main/skills/wechat-rewrite\\"}, {\\"name\\": \\"skills-cli\\", \\"repo\\": \\"redfox-data/redfox-community\\"}]", "displayStatus": 0, "downloadCount": 34464}	2026-07-01 10:23:45.342	2026-07-01 10:23:45.604	2026-07-01 10:23:45.604
cmr1xh4g70057i3k97hi8pi4o	kWxsznfM	xhs-title-scorer	小红书爆款标题打分器	xiaohongshu	uncategorized	["文案评分", "爆款标题", "xiaohongshu", "uncategorized"]			\N	\N	available	{"icon": "iconfont:baokuandazao", "tags": ["文案评分", "爆款标题"], "price": 0, "nameEn": "XHS Viral Title Scorer", "readme": "# 小红书爆款标题打分器 / xhs-title-scorer\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 简介\\n\\n基于小红书真实爆款数据，对你的标题进行 6 维度加权评分，并给出可落地的修改建议，帮你在发布前判断标题的流量潜力。\\n\\n**核心价值**\\n\\n- 用真实爆款数据说话，评分依据可追溯，不凭感觉打分\\n- 6 维度拆解标题短板，精准定位影响流量的关键问题\\n- 提供多风格修改版本，直接可用，无需二次构思\\n\\n**适用对象**\\n\\n- 📝 **小红书博主** — 发布前快速验证标题，减少低流量笔记\\n- 🛍️ **品牌 / 电商运营** — A/B 测试前筛掉明显弱势标题\\n- 🏢 **MCN / 内容策划** — 批量评估选题标题，提升内容投放效率\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 功能特性\\n\\n### 核心功能\\n\\n- **爆款数据驱动评分**：基于同赛道近期真实爆款，提炼结构、用词、情绪等规律，再对标你的标题打分\\n- **6 维度加权评分**：主题匹配度、结构合规度、利益清晰度、情绪唤醒度、稀缺性感知、合规安全性，按权重计算综合得分（满分 10 分）\\n- **等级判定**：S / A / B / C 四级，对应不同优化策略\\n- **爆款重合识别**：若你的标题与已有爆款高度一致，直接标注并给予 S 级认定\\n- **多风格修改建议**：A/B/C 级结果附带核心问题清单、参考爆款标题及干货风 / 情绪风 / 猎奇风修改版本\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 密钥获取与安全说明\\n\\n- 本技能需要使用环境变量：`REDFOX_API_KEY`。\\n- `REDFOX_API_KEY` 由 [红狐 hub](https://redfox.hk/settings/api-keys?source=github) (`https://redfox.hk`) 提供。\\n- 请前往 [红狐 hub](https://redfox.hk?source=github) 注册账号，获取 `REDFOX_API_KEY`。\\n- 配置设备环境变量 `REDFOX_API_KEY` 后使用本技能。\\n- 在提供密钥前，请先确认密钥来源、可用范围、有效期及是否支持重置/撤销。\\n- 禁止在代码、提示词、日志或输出文件中硬编码/明文暴露密钥。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用指南\\n\\n直接用自然语言描述你的标题和相关主题即可，无需记忆命令。\\n\\n### 常用说法速查\\n\\n| 意图 | 示例话术 | 效果 |\\n| ---- | -------- | ---- |\\n| 评分单个标题 | 「帮我评分'这款防晒霜真的绝了'，关键词防晒霜」 | 查询防晒霜爆款数据，输出 6 维度评分报告与优化建议 |\\n| 只给标题不给关键词 | 「'新手必看的护肤技巧' 这个标题如何」 | 自动从标题提取关键词，完成评分 |\\n| 指定主题方向 | 「评分'夏天这样穿超好看'，主题是夏日穿搭」 | 按夏日穿搭赛道爆款规律评分 |\\n\\n### 输出示例\\n\\n完成评分后，你将收到以下内容：\\n\\n**评分报告**（S / A / B / C 级 + 综合得分 + 6 维度明细表）\\n\\n**优化建议**（A/B/C 级时输出）：\\n- 核心问题清单\\n- 3 ～ 5 条同主题参考爆款标题（含作者与互动数）\\n- 2 ～ 3 个修改版本（干货风 / 情绪风 / 猎奇风）\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用场景\\n\\n| 场景 | 角色 | 示例问法 | 收益 |\\n| ---- | ---- | -------- | ---- |\\n| 发布前自检 | 博主 / 创作者 | 「这个标题能发吗？帮我打个分」 | 提前发现短板，避免低流量浪费曝光机会 |\\n| 多标题对比 | 内容运营 | 「这两个标题哪个更好，帮我分别评分」 | 用数据选出更优版本，减少主观判断失误 |\\n| 修改方向参考 | 新手博主 | 「我的标题评分低，给我改几个版本」 | 直接获得可发布的修改稿，降低创作门槛 |\\n| 赛道规律学习 | MCN 策划 | 「评分时告诉我这个赛道的爆款结构是什么」 | 在评分过程中积累同赛道爆款规律认知 |", "status": 1, "iconUrl": null, "skillNo": "kWxsznfM", "readmeEn": "# XHS Viral Title Scorer / xhs-title-scorer\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Introduction\\n\\nScores your Xiaohongshu (XHS) title across 6 weighted dimensions using real viral post data, and provides actionable revision suggestions to help you assess traffic potential before publishing.\\n\\n**Core Value**\\n\\n- Scoring is grounded in real viral data — every result is traceable, not based on gut feeling\\n- 6-dimension breakdown pinpoints the exact weaknesses affecting traffic\\n- Multi-style revision versions are ready to use, no extra brainstorming needed\\n\\n**Who It's For**\\n\\n- 📝 **XHS Creators** — Validate titles before publishing to reduce low-traffic posts\\n- 🛍️ **Brand / E-commerce Teams** — Filter out weak titles before A/B testing\\n- 🏢 **MCN / Content Planners** — Batch-evaluate titles and improve content efficiency\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Features\\n\\n### Core Capabilities\\n\\n- **Viral-data-driven scoring**: Extracts structure, wording, and emotional patterns from real recent viral posts in the same niche, then scores your title against those benchmarks\\n- **6-dimension weighted scoring**: Topic relevance, structural compliance, benefit clarity, emotional appeal, perceived scarcity, and compliance safety — combined into a 10-point weighted score\\n- **Grade classification**: S / A / B / C grades, each mapped to a different optimization strategy\\n- **Viral overlap detection**: If your title closely matches an existing viral title, it is flagged and awarded an S grade automatically\\n- **Multi-style revision suggestions**: A/B/C-grade results include a list of core issues, 3–5 reference viral titles, and 2–3 revised versions (informational / emotional / curiosity-driven)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## API Key Acquisition & Security\\n\\n- This skill requires the environment variable: `REDFOX_API_KEY`.\\n- `REDFOX_API_KEY` is provided by [RedFoxHub](https://redfox.hk/settings/api-keys?source=github) (`https://redfox.hk`).\\n- Visit [RedFoxHub](https://redfox.hk?source=github) to register and obtain your `REDFOX_API_KEY`.\\n- Configure `REDFOX_API_KEY` as a device environment variable before using this skill.\\n- Before providing your key, verify its source, permitted scope, expiry, and whether it supports reset/revocation.\\n- Never hardcode or expose the key in plaintext within code, prompts, logs, or output files.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Usage Guide\\n\\nJust describe your title and topic in plain language — no commands to memorize.\\n\\n### Quick Reference\\n\\n| Intent | Example | Result |\\n| ------ | ------- | ------ |\\n| Score a single title | \\"Score this title: 'This sunscreen is absolutely amazing', keyword: sunscreen\\" | Fetches sunscreen viral data, outputs 6-dimension score report and suggestions |\\n| Title only, no keyword | \\"'Skincare tips every beginner must know' — how's this title?\\" | Automatically extracts keywords from the title and scores it |\\n| Specify topic direction | \\"Score 'Dressing like this in summer is so cute', topic: summer outfits\\" | Scores against viral benchmarks in the summer fashion niche |\\n\\n### Output Example\\n\\nAfter scoring, you will receive:\\n\\n**Score Report** (S / A / B / C grade + overall score + 6-dimension breakdown table)\\n\\n**Optimization Suggestions** (for A/B/C grades):\\n- Core issues list\\n- 3–5 reference viral titles in the same niche (with author and engagement count)\\n- 2–3 revised versions (informational / emotional / curiosity-driven)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Use Cases\\n\\n| Scenario | Role | Example | Benefit |\\n| -------- | ---- | ------- | ------- |\\n| Pre-publish check | Creator | \\"Is this title good enough? Give it a score.\\" | Catch weaknesses early and avoid wasting distribution on low-traffic titles |\\n| Comparing multiple titles | Content operator | \\"Score these two titles and tell me which is better.\\" | Use data to pick the stronger version instead of guessing |\\n| Getting revision direction | New creator | \\"My title scored low — can you rewrite a few versions?\\" | Receive ready-to-publish alternatives and lower the creative barrier |\\n| Learning niche patterns | MCN planner | \\"While scoring, explain the viral structure in this niche.\\" | Build niche pattern knowledge as a byproduct of the scoring process |", "hasApiKey": true, "introduce": "基于小红书真实爆款数据，对你的标题进行 6 维度加权评分，并给出可落地的修改建议，帮你在发布前判断标题的流量潜力。", "skillCode": "xhs-title-scorer", "skillName": "小红书爆款标题打分器", "sortOrder": 0, "viewCount": 75631, "categories": [{"categoryCode": "creation_assistant", "categoryName": "创作助手"}], "categoryId": 2, "createTime": "2026-06-02 16:56:08", "updateTime": "2026-06-11 15:00:01", "usageCount": 0, "description": null, "introduceEn": "Scores your Xiaohongshu (XHS) title across 6 weighted dimensions using real viral post data, and provides actionable revision suggestions to help you assess traffic potential before publishing.", "platformInfo": "[{\\"name\\": \\"github\\", \\"repo\\": \\"https://github.com/redfox-data/redfox-community/tree/main/skills/xhs-title-scorer\\"}, {\\"name\\": \\"skills-cli\\", \\"repo\\": \\"redfox-data/redfox-community\\"}]", "displayStatus": 0, "downloadCount": 213073}	2026-07-01 10:23:45.342	2026-07-01 10:23:45.607	2026-07-01 10:23:45.607
cmr1xh4ga0058i3k9asion4rd	R9Xfe5vN	xiaohongshu-note-analyzer	小红书笔记优化助手	xiaohongshu	uncategorized	["文案评分", "爆款内容", "文案改写", "xiaohongshu", "uncategorized"]			\N	\N	available	{"icon": "iconfont:xiezi", "tags": ["文案评分", "爆款内容", "文案改写"], "price": 0, "nameEn": "XHS Copywriting Score", "readme": "# 小红书笔记优化助手 / xiaohongshu-note-analyzer\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 简介\\n\\n基于全网每日持续收录的 **2000+** 条爆款笔记数据，对你的小红书文案进行多维度评分，输出具体改进建议和优化方向，帮你提升文案质量与流量表现。\\n\\n**核心价值**\\n\\n- **真实数据背书**：每次评分均基于实时查询到的爆款笔记，而非经验判断，结论有据可查。\\n- **四维精准评分**：从关键词覆盖、结构完整度、时效性、内容质量四个维度逐一打分，定位短板一目了然。\\n- **可落地的改进建议**：针对低分维度给出具体改法指导，仅改问题部分，保留你的原文风格与语气。\\n\\n**适用对象**\\n\\n- 📝 **小红书博主** — 发布前快速自检文案质量，降低踩雷概率。\\n- 🛍️ **品牌 / 电商运营** — 评估推广文案与平台爆款规律的匹配度。\\n- 🏢 **MCN / 内容策划** — 批量审核内容，建立可量化的文案质量标准。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 功能特性\\n\\n### 核心功能\\n\\n- **关键词覆盖分析**：对比同赛道爆款高频词，识别文案中缺失的流量词汇。\\n- **结构完整度评分**：检测开头钩子、分点干货、互动引导等爆款结构要素是否到位。\\n- **时效性判断**：评估文案是否结合近期热点、季节或节日，提升内容应景感。\\n- **内容质量评估**：综合干货密度、排版清晰度、Emoji 使用等维度衡量可读性。\\n- **精准优化输出**：用户确认后，只修改低分维度对应内容，一字不动高分部分，避免整篇重写。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 密钥获取与安全说明\\n\\n- 本技能需要使用环境变量：`REDFOX_API_KEY`。\\n- `REDFOX_API_KEY` 由 [红狐 hub](https://redfox.hk/settings/api-keys?source=github) (`https://redfox.hk`) 提供。\\n- 请前往 [红狐 hub](https://redfox.hk?source=github) 注册账号，获取 `REDFOX_API_KEY`。\\n- 配置设备环境变量 `REDFOX_API_KEY` 后使用本技能。\\n- 在提供密钥前，请先确认密钥来源、可用范围、有效期及是否支持重置/撤销。\\n- 禁止在代码、提示词、日志或输出文件中硬编码/明文暴露密钥。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用指南\\n\\n直接把你的小红书文案正文发过来即可，无需记忆固定命令。\\n\\n### 常用说法速查\\n\\n| 意图         | 示例话术                       | 效果                                     |\\n| ------------ | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\\n| 评估文案质量 | 「帮我看看这篇文案写得怎么样」 | 基于爆款数据四维评分，输出总分与维度拆解 |\\n| 找出具体问题 | 「这篇文案有什么问题」         | 定位低分维度，给出可操作的改进建议       |\\n| 判断爆款潜力 | 「我的文案能火吗」             | 与同赛道爆款规律对比，给出客观评级       |\\n| 直接发文案   | 粘贴文案正文                   | 自动识别主题，提取关键词后开始评分       |\\n| 确认优化     | 「帮我优化一下」               | 输出改法指导 + 保留原味的优化版文案      |\\n\\n### 输出示例\\n\\n评分完成后，你将收到类似以下结构的报告：\\n\\n**评分结果**：总分 XX/100，评级（优秀 / 良好 / 一般 / 需改进）\\n\\n**维度拆解表**：关键词覆盖、结构完整度、时效性、内容质量各维度得分及说明\\n\\n**改进建议**：针对低分维度的具体可操作建议（仅在未达优秀时提供）\\n\\n**参考爆款规律**：提炼自真实数据的爆款公式，如「痛点开场 + 分点干货 + 互动收尾」\\n\\n**参考的爆款笔记**：2～3 篇本次分析所参考的真实爆款，附互动数据与链接\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用场景\\n\\n| 场景       | 角色           | 示例问法                           | 收益                           |\\n| ---------- | -------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\\n| 发布前自检 | 博主 / 创作者  | 「帮我看看这篇探店文案写得怎么样」 | 发布前发现短板，避免低流量     |\\n| 找改进方向 | 运营 / 编导    | 「这篇文案有什么问题，怎么改」     | 精准定位问题，获得可落地的改法 |\\n| 对标爆款   | 新手博主       | 「我的文案和爆款差在哪里」         | 了解差距，建立爆款文案认知     |\\n| 批量质检   | MCN / 内容团队 | 逐篇发送待审文案                   | 统一评分标准，提升团队产出质量 |", "status": 1, "iconUrl": null, "skillNo": "R9Xfe5vN", "readmeEn": "# XHS Copywriting Score / xiaohongshu-note-analyzer\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Introduction\\n\\nPowered by **2000+** viral notes collected daily across the platform, this skill scores your Xiaohongshu (XHS) copywriting across multiple dimensions, delivers concrete improvement suggestions, and helps you boost content quality and traffic performance.\\n\\n**Core Value**\\n\\n- **Real data foundation**: Every score is grounded in live viral notes retrieved on demand — not rule-of-thumb judgment — so every conclusion is traceable.\\n- **Four-dimension scoring**: Keyword coverage, structural completeness, timeliness, and content quality are scored individually, pinpointing weak spots at a glance.\\n- **Actionable improvement guidance**: Only the underperforming sections are rewritten; your original voice and style stay intact.\\n\\n**Who It's For**\\n\\n- 📝 **XHS Creators** — Run a quick quality check before publishing to reduce the chance of low traffic.\\n- 🛍️ **Brand / E-commerce Operators** — Measure how well promotional copy aligns with current viral patterns.\\n- 🏢 **MCN / Content Teams** — Review content at scale and establish a quantifiable copywriting quality standard.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Features\\n\\n### Core Capabilities\\n\\n- **Keyword Coverage Analysis**: Compares your copy against high-frequency words in viral notes from the same niche to identify missing traffic keywords.\\n- **Structural Completeness Scoring**: Checks for key viral elements — opening hook, bulleted tips, and engagement call-to-action.\\n- **Timeliness Assessment**: Evaluates whether the copy connects to recent trends, seasons, or holidays to enhance contextual relevance.\\n- **Content Quality Evaluation**: Measures readability through tip density, layout clarity, and emoji usage.\\n- **Precision Optimization**: Upon confirmation, only low-scoring sections are revised — high-scoring parts remain untouched to avoid full rewrites.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## API Key Acquisition & Security\\n\\n- This skill requires the environment variable: `REDFOX_API_KEY`.\\n- `REDFOX_API_KEY` is provided by [RedFoxHub](https://redfox.hk/settings/api-keys?source=github) (`https://redfox.hk`).\\n- Visit [RedFoxHub](https://redfox.hk?source=github) to register and obtain your `REDFOX_API_KEY`.\\n- Configure the environment variable `REDFOX_API_KEY` on your device before using this skill.\\n- Before supplying a key, confirm its source, permitted scope, expiry, and whether it can be reset or revoked.\\n- Never hard-code or expose the key in plain text within code, prompts, logs, or output files.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Usage Guide\\n\\nJust paste your XHS copy directly — no commands to memorize.\\n\\n### Quick Reference\\n\\n| Intent                 | Example Phrase                        | Result                                                                      |\\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\\n| Evaluate copy quality  | \\"Check how well this copy is written\\" | Four-dimension score with a detailed breakdown                              |\\n| Find specific problems | \\"What's wrong with this copy?\\"        | Identifies low-scoring dimensions with actionable fixes                     |\\n| Gauge viral potential  | \\"Can this copy go viral?\\"             | Compares against same-niche viral patterns for an objective rating          |\\n| Paste copy directly    | Paste the body text                   | Auto-detects topic, extracts keywords, and starts scoring                   |\\n| Request optimization   | \\"Help me improve it\\"                  | Outputs a rewrite guide + an improved version that keeps your original tone |\\n\\n### Output Example\\n\\nAfter scoring, you will receive a report structured as follows:\\n\\n**Score**: Total XX/100 with a rating (Excellent / Good / Average / Needs Work)\\n\\n**Dimension Breakdown**: Individual scores and explanations for keyword coverage, structural completeness, timeliness, and content quality\\n\\n**Improvement Suggestions**: Specific, actionable advice for underperforming dimensions (provided when rating is below Excellent)\\n\\n**Viral Formula Reference**: A pattern distilled from real data, e.g. \\"Pain-point opener + bullet tips + engagement close\\"\\n\\n**Reference Viral Notes**: 2–3 real viral notes used in this analysis, with engagement metrics and links\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Use Cases\\n\\n| Scenario                      | Role               | Example Request                                          | Benefit                                                    |\\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\\n| Pre-publish check             | Creator / Blogger  | \\"Check this restaurant review copy before I post it\\"     | Catch weaknesses before going live                         |\\n| Find improvement direction    | Operator / Editor  | \\"What's wrong with this copy and how do I fix it?\\"       | Pinpoint issues with concrete, actionable fixes            |\\n| Benchmark against viral notes | New creator        | \\"Where does my copy fall short compared to viral posts?\\" | Understand the gap and build a viral copywriting intuition |\\n| Batch quality review          | MCN / Content team | Submit copies one by one for review                      | Standardize quality benchmarks and improve team output     |", "hasApiKey": true, "introduce": "基于全网每日持续收录的 2000+ 条爆款笔记数据，对你的小红书文案进行多维度评分，输出具体改进建议和优化方向，帮你提升文案质量与流量表现。", "skillCode": "xiaohongshu-note-analyzer", "skillName": "小红书笔记优化助手", "sortOrder": 0, "viewCount": 163677, "categories": [{"categoryCode": "xhs_skills", "categoryName": "小红书创作技能包"}], "categoryId": 10, "createTime": "2026-06-02 16:57:32", "updateTime": "2026-06-11 15:00:01", "usageCount": 0, "description": null, "introduceEn": "Powered by 2000+ viral notes collected daily across the platform, this skill scores your Xiaohongshu (XHS) copywriting across multiple dimensions, delivers concrete improvement suggestions, and helps you boost content quality and traffic performance.", "platformInfo": "[{\\"name\\": \\"github\\", \\"repo\\": \\"https://github.com/redfox-data/redfox-community/tree/main/skills/xiaohongshu-note-analyzer\\"}, {\\"name\\": \\"skills-cli\\", \\"repo\\": \\"redfox-data/redfox-community\\"}]", "displayStatus": 0, "downloadCount": 53192}	2026-07-01 10:23:45.342	2026-07-01 10:23:45.611	2026-07-01 10:23:45.611
cmr1xh4gd0059i3k9tjd4apgf	tmcjp4jB	xiaohongshu-rewrite	小红书文案改写	xiaohongshu	uncategorized	["文案改写", "内容创作", "xiaohongshu", "uncategorized"]			\N	\N	available	{"icon": "iconfont:sign-review", "tags": ["文案改写", "内容创作"], "price": 0, "nameEn": "Xiaohongshu Copy Rewrite", "readme": "# 小红书文案改写 / xiaohongshu-rewrite\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 简介\\n\\n把产品介绍、使用体验、攻略分享等原文，改写成符合小红书阅读习惯的正文——有吸睛标题、充足 Emoji 和结尾话题标签，读起来像真实博主在分享。\\n\\n**核心价值**\\n\\n- **平台语感对齐**：口语化、有节奏，贴近小红书常见的种草与分享表达\\n- **视觉化阅读**：标题与正文融入 Emoji，增强活力与点击欲（至少 5 个不重复表情）\\n- **即改即发**：一次输出标题 + 正文 + `#` 标签，可直接用于笔记发布\\n- **结构保留**：在切换风格的同时，尽量保持原文段落结构，方便对照修改\\n\\n**适用对象**\\n\\n- 📝 **小红书博主** — 把粗糙草稿快速改成可发布的笔记文案\\n- 🛍️ **品牌 / 电商运营** — 统一产品卖点的小红书话术与标签\\n- 📱 **多平台创作者** — 将公众号、知乎等长文改写成小红书短笔记风格\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 功能特性\\n\\n### 核心功能\\n\\n- **小红书风格改写**：输入原文，输出带标题的小红书风格成稿\\n- **吸睛标题**：采用悬念、正反刺激等常见笔记标题手法，提升打开意愿\\n- **Emoji 强化表达**：全文使用至少 5 个不重复的 Emoji，标题与段落均有点缀\\n- **话题标签**：正文末尾附带与内容强相关的 `#` Tags，便于搜索与推荐\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用指南\\n\\n直接粘贴或描述需要改写的文案即可。\\n\\n### 常用说法速查\\n\\n| 意图         | 示例话术                                                   | 效果                                   |\\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\\n| 改写成笔记   | 「帮我把下面这段改成小红书风格：[你的原文]」               | 输出标题 + 正文 + 结尾 Tags            |\\n| 产品种草     | 「这款精华液主打修护，改写成小红书种草文案」               | 口语化卖点表达，附相关话题标签         |\\n| 攻略分享     | 「周末 citywalk 路线，改成小红书攻略笔记」                 | 结构清晰、Emoji 丰富、适合笔记排版     |\\n| 强化标题     | 「标题再抓人一点，正文保持小红书口吻」                     | 加强开头钩子，整体仍符合平台习惯       |\\n\\n### 输出示例\\n\\n完成改写后，你将收到类似结构的内容（示意）：\\n\\n```text\\n# 标题（含 Emoji，有吸引力）\\n\\n正文段落一 ✨ …\\n正文段落二 💡 …\\n（全文至少 5 个不重复 Emoji）\\n\\n#护肤 #好物分享 #种草\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 使用场景\\n\\n| 场景         | 角色       | 示例问法                                       | 收益                           |\\n| ------------ | ---------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\\n| 新品上架     | 电商运营   | 「把产品详情改写成小红书首发笔记」             | 缩短从商品信息到笔记文案的时间 |\\n| 体验复盘     | 博主       | 「把这次探店经历改成小红书分享稿」             | 真实感强、标签齐全，便于发布   |\\n| 跨平台改编   | 自媒体     | 「把这篇公众号文章压缩成小红书笔记」           | 同一素材适配 RED 用户阅读习惯  |\\n| 活动预热     | 品牌市场   | 「周年庆活动通知，改成小红书预热文案」         | 语气更轻、传播点更集中         |\\n\\n---", "status": 1, "iconUrl": null, "skillNo": "tmcjp4jB", "readmeEn": "# Xiaohongshu Copy Rewrite / xiaohongshu-rewrite\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Introduction\\n\\nTurn product intros, experience notes, or how-to drafts into Xiaohongshu (RED)–style posts—catchy titles, rich emoji, and closing topic tags that read like a real creator sharing.\\n\\n**Core Value**\\n\\n- **Platform-native voice**: Conversational, rhythmic copy aligned with common seeding and sharing patterns on RED\\n- **Visual readability**: Emoji in titles and body for energy and scroll-stopping appeal (at least 5 unique emoji)\\n- **Ready to post**: One pass delivers title + body + `#` tags for note publishing\\n- **Structure preserved**: Keeps your original paragraph layout while switching style, so edits stay easy\\n\\n**Who It’s For**\\n\\n- 📝 **RED creators** — Polish rough drafts into publishable note copy quickly\\n- 🛍️ **Brand / e-commerce ops** — Align product selling points with RED tone and tags\\n- 📱 **Cross-platform creators** — Adapt WeChat, Zhihu, or other long-form text into short RED notes\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Features\\n\\n### Core Capabilities\\n\\n- **RED-style rewrite**: Input source text; get a titled Xiaohongshu-style piece\\n- **Hook titles**: Suspense and contrast patterns common in high-performing note titles\\n- **Emoji throughout**: At least 5 non-repeating emoji across title and body\\n- **Topic tags**: Closing `#` tags strongly tied to the content for discovery\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Usage Guide\\n\\nPaste or describe the copy you want rewritten.\\n\\n### Quick Reference\\n\\n| Intent           | Example phrase                                                      | Result                                      |\\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\\n| Full note rewrite| “Rewrite this in Xiaohongshu style: [your draft]”                   | Title + body + closing tags                 |\\n| Product seeding  | “This serum focuses on repair—make it a RED seeding post”         | Conversational benefits + relevant tags     |\\n| How-to share     | “Weekend city-walk route—turn it into a RED guide note”             | Clear structure, rich emoji, note-friendly  |\\n| Stronger title   | “Make the title punchier; keep the RED voice in the body”           | Sharper hook, still platform-appropriate    |\\n\\n### Output Example\\n\\nAfter rewriting, you’ll get content roughly like:\\n\\n```text\\n# Title (with emoji, attention-grabbing)\\n\\nBody paragraph one ✨ …\\nBody paragraph two 💡 …\\n(at least 5 unique emoji in full text)\\n\\n#skincare #musthave #seeding\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Use Cases\\n\\n| Scenario           | Role      | Example question                                           | Benefit                                      |\\n| ------------------ | --------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\\n| New product launch | E-com ops | “Turn this product detail into a RED launch note”          | Faster path from specs to note copy          |\\n| Experience recap   | Creator   | “Rewrite this store visit as a RED sharing post”           | Authentic tone, tags included, ready to post |\\n| Cross-platform     | Creator   | “Compress this WeChat article into a RED note”             | Same material, RED reading habits            |\\n| Campaign warm-up   | Brand     | “Rewrite this anniversary promo as a RED teaser”           | Lighter tone, focused share points           |\\n\\n---", "hasApiKey": false, "introduce": "把产品介绍、使用体验、攻略分享等原文，改写成符合小红书阅读习惯的正文——有吸睛标题、充足 Emoji 和结尾话题标签，读起来像真实博主在分享。", "skillCode": "xiaohongshu-rewrite", "skillName": "小红书文案改写", "sortOrder": 0, "viewCount": 180726, "categories": [{"categoryCode": "creation_assistant", "categoryName": "创作助手"}], "categoryId": 2, "createTime": "2026-06-02 16:58:47", "updateTime": "2026-06-11 15:00:01", "usageCount": 0, "description": null, "introduceEn": "Turn product intros, experience notes, or how-to drafts into Xiaohongshu (RED)–style posts—catchy titles, rich emoji, and closing topic tags that read like a real creator sharing.", "platformInfo": "[{\\"name\\": \\"github\\", \\"repo\\": \\"https://github.com/redfox-data/redfox-community/tree/main/skills/xiaohongshu-rewrite\\"}, {\\"name\\": \\"skills-cli\\", \\"repo\\": \\"redfox-data/redfox-community\\"}]", "displayStatus": 0, "downloadCount": 115480}	2026-07-01 10:23:45.342	2026-07-01 10:23:45.614	2026-07-01 10:23:45.614
